{"ID":"20240314091941-95504k7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091941-95504k7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091941-95504k7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164311-poi3uyw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164413-cf5cnj9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2180,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164413-cf5cnj9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:15\u0026#125;","title":"【桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤】\u0026amp;【枳术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164311-poi3uyw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-poi3uyw","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"师曰：寸口脉迟而涩，迟则为寒，涩为血不足；趺阳脉微而迟，微则为气，迟则为寒。寒气不足，即手足逆冷；手足逆冷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"则营卫不利；营卫不利，则腹满胁鸣，相逐气转，膀胱营卫俱劳，阳气不通，即身冷，阴气不通，即骨疼。阳前通则恶寒，阴前通则痹不仁。阴阳相得，其气乃行，大气一转，其气乃散，实则矢气，虚则遗溺，名曰气分。气分，心下坚大如盘，边如旋盘，桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-kbbmei1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-kbbmei1","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（桂枝汤去芍药加麻黄附子细辛汤）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-nlu8cyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-nlu8cyi","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝、生姜各三两，细辛、甘草、麻黄各二两，附子一枚炮，大枣十二枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-pg1xph2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-pg1xph2","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水七升，先煮麻黄去上沫，纳诸药，煮取二升，分温三服，当汗出，如虫行皮中，即愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-c2b3g79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-c2b3g79","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下面这个段落呢，在经方上，在历史上呢一直是个迷团"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，很多经方家来解释，那我试着让你了解我们什么时候要用这个处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-10676eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-10676eu","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个整个讲的是一个气分，大家看：“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寸口脉就是阳脉，迟而涩，迟则为寒，涩为血不足；跌阳脉（胃脉呢）微而迟，微则为气，迟则为寒。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒气不足呢，即手足逆冷；手足逆冷呢，则营卫不利；营卫不利，则腹满胁鸣，相逐气转。膀胱呢，这个营卫俱劳，阳气不通，即身冷，阴气不通，即骨疼。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”什么叫“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳前通则恶寒，阴前通则痹不仁。阴阳想得，其气乃行，大气一转，其气乃散。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”这个讲什么东西？我画个图给你看。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-ha1pp6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-ha1pp6k","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240407165218-sqqw12d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-ibjlpw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-ibjlpw9","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《黄帝内经》里面写得很清楚，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当医生不知阴阳，不能当医生，不能看病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！阴阳怎么看它？大家都我讲出来都是你耳熟能详的哦，你们都读过。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹为阴，胸为阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”对不对？是不是就有了？什么叫做腹为阴？写个 8，12345678 的8，8字你写的时候，你看我的方向，箭头是这个样子（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），肚脐呢是阴阳的交汇点。所以，下面是阴呢，它走的方向呢是这样子走（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脐下黄粉笔痕迹，顺时针走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），阴的走的方向，为了帮助你们记忆，大肠在里面的时候，大肠是不是升再横再降？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脐下黄粉笔痕迹，顺时针走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）升结肠、横结肠、降结肠，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以大便是这样走的，顺着阴脉这样走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你如果逆着走就不成为阴，所以，你按照大肠巡行的方向你就可以记得这是阴走的方向，所以阴这样走一圈以后回到阳，阳再从这边开始，从肚脐跨上去以后到肋间再回头走这边下来（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脐上逆时针走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这是阴阳的大气一转。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-qfnqj36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-qfnqj36","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常人，当一个医生我们一定要知道什么叫做正常人，你要了解正常才知道病情是转坏还是转好，现在最大的问题就是，西医呢把人定为正常的标准，那是太低了！所以验血报告你都在指数以内，实际上脚冷手冷，里面还有很多痰很多饮在里面，很多浮饮啊流饮在里面，定位太低了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-8wwhqp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-8wwhqp4","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医呢，一直没有把健康的标准找出来，健康的标准出来以后，如果阴阳气是这样转的时候（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），阳中就会有阴，阴中就会有阳，因为阴阳是非常的协调。所以头面，上面是阳，但是你摸到是冷的，是阴嘛；下面呢是阴，照理说是寒的，可是实际上下面是热的，所以正常的人呢是上面是冷的，下面是热的。那不正常的人，老师我怎么搞的，上半身是热的，下半身是冷的，这时候就开始动手，千万别等到肿得很大了，还不自知，还在那边晃，还觉得没什么，对不对？那你年轻气盛哦，等到哪天你阳衰了你就知道了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-j2sbr9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-j2sbr9k","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"开始有病的时候我们就要开始有动作，这个阴阳气在转的时候，分两证，第一个：气分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这里讲的是气分，待会我要回头再讲血分给你听。讲到血分的时候就会分析到阴实证，包括肝硬化，脾脏...包括肺癌啊，统统在里面，那是血分，这里讲的是气分。我们现在有了这个基本的概念以后，诸位来回头看，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"营卫不利..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”他这个卫气，什么意思？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你的胃气太冷了，太寒的时候，再加上肺，胸腔也是寒的时候，上下都是寒，这个时候我们饮水入胃，不管你吃的食物到胃里面去，这个胃它没有办法完全消化掉，因为是气分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，什么叫气分，就是...肠胃就是气分。气分的力量不够，所以你喝进去的水呢没有办法气化出来。这个时候五脏肝心脾肺肾，并不是有病的状态之下...有重病的状态之下，这时候你没有办法把水、气化掉，小肠也没有办法把这个完全蒸化掉；这个当你的水无法化为气的时候，这个水比较冷，就是比较可以看到不是气，是水。这时候慢慢累积在...水就没有办法入脏啊，没有办法进入肝脏，没有办法进入脾脏，没有办法进入肾脏；肺脏又冷，这个时候呢，就是开始（有病）了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-9ggkwwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-9ggkwwk","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240407172135-otmtrno.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-s7rbys7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-s7rbys7","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸腔肋骨这边到腹腔这边，刚好在循这肋骨这一圈呢成为一个大圆盘，为什么边有硬块在这边？就是因为寒，寒造成了这个水没有办法气化，结果肚子变得很大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以我们可以看这个症状的时候我们知道它是气分，是阳不够才造成的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以，因为阳不够，所以阴才会积在这里面......阴积，津液累积在这个地方。所以呢，现在诸位回头看条辩：这个“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手脚逆冷"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，我们手脚跟胃有关系，手脚的温度热的代表肠胃是热的，手脚的温度比较常常是手冷脚冷的肠胃都比较冷，尤其是脚，因为你的胃经呢到脚上面去。当营卫气血不利的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们上焦把它定为气，下焦把它定为血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，营卫不利的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹满胁鸣，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肚子胀满，胸胁....这个肋骨这边呢会有水声，这个时候相逐气转，阴阳气呢本来要循环的，结果过去又上不去，因为这边堵到了。这中间呢整个膈呢堵到了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"8字中间画上一横为中膈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），因为寒嘛，堵到了。结果阴气在下面转，又没办法转回成阳气在上面转，我们人身上转得是这个 8，一直这样动的，中间隔掉以后呢，就变成气在这里转（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"8字下方的o自转，没法循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），自己在转自己，就是阴在下面，阳在上面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-xjesu6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-xjesu6y","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳前通则恶寒，阴前通则痹不仁"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”这个是上面是寒的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"8字上方o"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），所以是感觉到身体是冷的，下方也是寒的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"8字下方o"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），感觉到身体肌肉麻痹不仁；这个腹部呢，脾主少腹，是脾脏在管，所以脾主肌肉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以当你腹部是寒的时候，肌肉会麻痹，会有这种现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴阳相得"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那阴阳呢一定要相得，就是阴阳一定要互相（转），一定要‘得’才能够循环。这就是为什么我们练功夫，九转旋功......希望大家能够以肚脐为中心在旋转的意思在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-fts7jii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-fts7jii","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当阴阳气要相得，大气一转，这个寒气才会散掉。实症呢放屁放得多"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（实则矢气），虚则遗溺"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为实症的时候寒湿很盛，诸位看，因为小肠这边呢阴气很盛，但是没有办法化升成阳，食物堵在里面，堵久了以后自然而然就排气，因为食物里面呢很多五谷杂粮啊会产生很多沼气。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-lteuujv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-lteuujv","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果是虚证的话，那里面是寒的，所以小便没有办法气化出来，都漏出来的，这个叫做气分。我现在讲的因为它是气分，这是气走的方向，气走的方向是阳不足，造成阴还会累积在里面，所以我们开的处方要怎么样？要行阳要生阳的药，要阳的药才开在里面，这是基本上的一个概念。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-0hkg0qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-0hkg0qi","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你有气分的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心下坚大如盘"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是心的下方那，诸位可以看到环绕肚子一圈硬邦邦的坚大如盘。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"边如旋盘"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么？因为寒湿哽在这边，这是因为肠胃里面的津液呢，化生的营养没有办法进入脏变成梗到在这个地方。那桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-pzy3ubb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-pzy3ubb","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把白芍拿掉，因为白芍是阴药，我们知道它是阴太盛了，你怎么会还会用白芍把阴增加，增加阴的分量？不要，把白芍拿掉，因为要行阳，靠桂枝。所以，我一直在跟诸位讲，调整人身上的阴阳，就看...整个经方里面讲的是就桂枝白芍，所以，我们知道这个处方是阳虚，所以我们把白芍拿掉，加上重用桂枝，桂枝一上去以后硬把它打下来，因为桂枝可以把心火导到小肠里面来；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有麻黄，为什么？也是行阳，也是阳药，细辛附子通通是阳药，这是少阴证，少阴证专门去下焦的寒实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。寒实跟阴实不一样哦，我待会介绍阴实给你看。现在是气分，气分的时候通通是寒实，实，我们知道东西堵到了，我们要把它化解，寒呢，像冰块一样，我们要把它融解掉，所以才会有麻黄附子细辛汤，这个药吃下去以后呢一剂就知！肚子就水都退掉了，所以气分...吃下去以后阳气就很壮。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-j3wz22p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-j3wz22p","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那处方的时候，诸位看：桂枝三钱，生姜，细辛呢、麻黄二，炮附子一，就一钱，这个处方呢用六碗水煮两碗，你用七碗水也可以，看你的剂量，我刚刚一再跟诸位强调，读经方的时候，后面的说明你可以参考它，不一定要真正按照剂量，按照这个剂量都汉朝的剂量，所以你要看病人的大小来决定，像你看我的体格可以用到麻黄三钱，麻黄四钱我心脏就受不了了，麻黄五钱我都要扁你了！你要害我嘛，害我，怎么可以害我？这个这个......（在座学生笑）所以看剂量！那看那体格比较小的两钱嘛，小 baby 半钱，加减就是这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164311-4cjkg7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164311-4cjkg7b","updated":"20240422164311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个呢，像我前面一再跟大家强调，这个先煮麻黄，这种都是我们在临床时候都是把麻黄剂量放小一点，一次煮完就好了。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当汗出"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吃完以后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如虫行皮中"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，为什么啊？因为阴阳气大气在转，大气在转的话阴阳会协调，皮肤也有阴阳，肌肉也有阴阳，什么地方都存在阴阳，对不对？所以才会有虫行在皮肤中间。比如说脾脏，脾脏也有阴阳啊，脾脏的外面有它的膜把脾脏保护住，所以脾的阴不会出来，也有阳在那边，所以一行阳的时候，脾脏的阳也会跟着动。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164412-n7d8tan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164412-n7d8tan"}},{"ID":"20240422164413-rvfwvma","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-rvfwvma","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下坚大如盘，边如旋盘，水饮所作，枳术汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-1vczsbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-1vczsbv","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳术汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-6mb91u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-6mb91u4","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实七枚，白术二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-4odvy8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-4odvy8h","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，以水五升，煮取三升，分温三服，腹中软，即当散也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-qai3u1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-qai3u1f","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你在开下一个方的时候，老师，这个“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心下坚大如盘，边如旋盘，水饮所作，枳术汤主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”老师一模一样很像啊，怎么样区分它？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里讲的是跟桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤症状很像"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）它这里讲的很清楚啊： “"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水饮所作"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-74fkxhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-74fkxhn","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240408082932-1sl2lm9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-dnqmqda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-dnqmqda","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃呢，胃的下方有水饮，当我们水没有办法气化的时候，有一种特殊的情形，他身体都没有问题，就是在胃的下方有水，胃的下方有水饮呢也会造成这种情形......阴阳气不通，这个时候我们用枳术汤......"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术呢祛湿，枳实呢能够把这个浊气水气能够让它融通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-6a4lazm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-6a4lazm","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说我们用枳实的时候，诸位我们再稍微回头一下，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们的小承气汤、大承气汤、调胃承气汤，很多地方呢我们会用到枳实，大柴胡汤就有枳实，四逆散也有枳实，为什么会有枳实？枳实真正的功能是怎么样？当我们的胃里面，消化不好的时候，比如这胃里面比较冷，消化不好的时候我们会产生很多的浊水，这个浊水实际上就是食物坏死掉以后那个水留下来的，枳实呢就可以专门针对这个浊水可以把它利掉，所以我们常常会用到枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-tzadhpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-tzadhpu","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这两味药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术、枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）可以把胃底下的水饮排掉，所以说会有两个症状看起来很像...所以说你如果说我们用这个处方回头看这个病的时候，这个病的意思是什么？病人说，脾脏呢，我们中医讲脾和胃是相表里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你脾脏湿很盛的时候，胃里面会有浊，没有办法排掉，浊会累积在里面。所以让脾湿能够去掉就要靠白术，胃里面的浊就要靠枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，枳术汤就这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-v5s4c4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-v5s4c4v","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以用体会的方式比较清楚，这两个症状唯一的差异都是一样肚子好像腹大巨如盘（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里讲的是跟桂甘姜枣麻辛附子汤症状很像"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），但是那个人呢胃很不舒服，胃难过；前面那个，桂枝、甘草、生姜、大枣，麻黄附子细辛胃没有不舒服。所以一个是治疗胃、一个是治疗阳气让它循环。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164413-cf5cnj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164413-cf5cnj9","updated":"20240422164413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好大家回头看 229 页..."}]}]}